    },
    {
      "id": "norma",
      "title": "Hypotéza, dispozice a sankce",
      "source_refs": [
        {
          "id": "5151228ea1ae5ea411544030cc5e38807a8db67220c3c4e259098becae027092",
          "sha256": "72fae6bbaacc50cb7996f36a179fb6dc2c4d6ad92a668ea640be7b931e11e14e",
          "page": 2
        },
        {
          "id": "5151228ea1ae5ea411544030cc5e38807a8db67220c3c4e259098becae027092",
          "sha256": "72fae6bbaacc50cb7996f36a179fb6dc2c4d6ad92a668ea640be7b931e11e14e",
          "page": 3
        },
        {
          "id": "5151228ea1ae5ea411544030cc5e38807a8db67220c3c4e259098becae027092",
          "sha256": "72fae6bbaacc50cb7996f36a179fb6dc2c4d6ad92a668ea640be7b931e11e14e",
          "page": 4
        },
        {
          "id": "5151228ea1ae5ea411544030cc5e38807a8db67220c3c4e259098becae027092",
          "sha256": "72fae6bbaacc50cb7996f36a179fb6dc2c4d6ad92a668ea640be7b931e11e14e",
          "page": 5
        }
      ],
      "blocks": [
        {
          "type": "paragraph",
          "text": "Hypotéza vymezuje, kdy, kde, na koho nebo za jakých okolností se pravidlo použije. Dispozice vyjadřuje požadované či dovolené chování. Sankce popisuje následek porušení. Rozklad je nástroj k pochopení pravidla: podmínka → chování → následek.",
          "source_refs": [
            {
              "id": "5151228ea1ae5ea411544030cc5e38807a8db67220c3c4e259098becae027092",
              "sha256": "72fae6bbaacc50cb7996f36a179fb6dc2c4d6ad92a668ea640be7b931e11e14e",
              "page": 2
            },
            {
              "id": "5151228ea1ae5ea411544030cc5e38807a8db67220c3c4e259098becae027092",
              "sha256": "72fae6bbaacc50cb7996f36a179fb6dc2c4d6ad92a668ea640be7b931e11e14e",
              "page": 3
            },
            {
              "id": "5151228ea1ae5ea411544030cc5e38807a8db67220c3c4e259098becae027092",
              "sha256": "72fae6bbaacc50cb7996f36a179fb6dc2c4d6ad92a668ea640be7b931e11e14e",
              "page": 4
            },
            {
              "id": "5151228ea1ae5ea411544030cc5e38807a8db67220c3c4e259098becae027092",
              "sha256": "72fae6bbaacc50cb7996f36a179fb6dc2c4d6ad92a668ea640be7b931e11e14e",
              "page": 5
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "type": "paragraph",
          "text": "Prezentace sama upozorňuje, že některé opravňující normy sankci neobsahují. Není tedy bezpečné memorovat úvodní schéma jako tvrzení, že v každé jednotlivé větě předpisu najdeme výslovně všechny tři části.",
          "source_refs": [
            {
              "id": "5151228ea1ae5ea411544030cc5e38807a8db67220c3c4e259098becae027092",
              "sha256": "72fae6bbaacc50cb7996f36a179fb6dc2c4d6ad92a668ea640be7b931e11e14e",
              "page": 2
            },
            {
              "id": "5151228ea1ae5ea411544030cc5e38807a8db67220c3c4e259098becae027092",
              "sha256": "72fae6bbaacc50cb7996f36a179fb6dc2c4d6ad92a668ea640be7b931e11e14e",
              "page": 5
            }
          ]
        }
      ],
      "steps": [
        {
          "title": "Najdi podmínku",
          "text": "Ptej se kdy, kde, kdo a za jakých okolností.",
          "source_refs": [
            {
              "id": "5151228ea1ae5ea411544030cc5e38807a8db67220c3c4e259098becae027092",
              "sha256": "72fae6bbaacc50cb7996f36a179fb6dc2c4d6ad92a668ea640be7b931e11e14e",
              "page": 2
            },
            {
              "id": "5151228ea1ae5ea411544030cc5e38807a8db67220c3c4e259098becae027092",
              "sha256": "72fae6bbaacc50cb7996f36a179fb6dc2c4d6ad92a668ea640be7b931e11e14e",
              "page": 3
            },
            {
              "id": "5151228ea1ae5ea411544030cc5e38807a8db67220c3c4e259098becae027092",
              "sha256": "72fae6bbaacc50cb7996f36a179fb6dc2c4d6ad92a668ea640be7b931e11e14e",
              "page": 4
            },
            {
              "id": "5151228ea1ae5ea411544030cc5e38807a8db67220c3c4e259098becae027092",
              "sha256": "72fae6bbaacc50cb7996f36a179fb6dc2c4d6ad92a668ea640be7b931e11e14e",
              "page": 5
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "title": "Najdi požadované chování",
          "text": "Urči, co se musí, nesmí nebo může udělat.",
          "source_refs": [
            {
              "id": "5151228ea1ae5ea411544030cc5e38807a8db67220c3c4e259098becae027092",
              "sha256": "72fae6bbaacc50cb7996f36a179fb6dc2c4d6ad92a668ea640be7b931e11e14e",
              "page": 2
            },
            {
              "id": "5151228ea1ae5ea411544030cc5e38807a8db67220c3c4e259098becae027092",
              "sha256": "72fae6bbaacc50cb7996f36a179fb6dc2c4d6ad92a668ea640be7b931e11e14e",
              "page": 3
            },
            {
              "id": "5151228ea1ae5ea411544030cc5e38807a8db67220c3c4e259098becae027092",
              "sha256": "72fae6bbaacc50cb7996f36a179fb6dc2c4d6ad92a668ea640be7b931e11e14e",
              "page": 4
            },
            {
              "id": "5151228ea1ae5ea411544030cc5e38807a8db67220c3c4e259098becae027092",
              "sha256": "72fae6bbaacc50cb7996f36a179fb6dc2c4d6ad92a668ea640be7b931e11e14e",
              "page": 5
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "title": "Najdi následek",
          "text": "Pokud jej ukázka uvádí, odděl následek porušení od samotné povinnosti.",
          "source_refs": [
            {
              "id": "5151228ea1ae5ea411544030cc5e38807a8db67220c3c4e259098becae027092",
              "sha256": "72fae6bbaacc50cb7996f36a179fb6dc2c4d6ad92a668ea640be7b931e11e14e",
              "page": 2
            },
            {
              "id": "5151228ea1ae5ea411544030cc5e38807a8db67220c3c4e259098becae027092",
